    "title": "黑暗洛奇亚（PCG-P）",
    "pageid": 188600,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>陰暗洛奇亞</b>（日文︰<b><span lang=\"ja\">ダーク・ルギア</span></b>，英文︰<b>Shadow Lugia</b>）是一張<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\">超</a>屬性的<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"基礎寶可夢（TCG）\">基礎寶可夢</a>卡。\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目次</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#卡牌信息\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">卡牌資訊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#收录卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">收錄卡包</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#日文和英文卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><span><b>日文和英文卡包</b></span></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#获得方式\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">獲得方式</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#PCG系列\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">PCG系列</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#EX系列\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">EX系列</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#细节\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">細節</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8D.A1.E7.89.8C.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"卡牌信息\">卡牌資訊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9A%EF%BC%88PCG-P%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：卡牌資訊\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9A%EF%BC%88PCG-P%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 卡牌資訊\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"bg-超C bd-超C roundy-15 at-c a-c\" style=\"border-width:3px;max-width:500px;width:100%;background: -webkit-linear-gradient(to bottom right, #A65E9A 10%, # 35%, # 50%, #A65E9A 80%, # 100%); background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #A65E9A 10%, # 35%, # 50%, #A65E9A 80%, # 100%);&#124;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C bgl-钢 textblack at-c\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.2em;color:initial;width:20%;white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"基礎寶可夢（TCG）\">基礎</a></b><br />\n</td>\n<th class=\"roundybr-25 bg-魂银 bd-超C\" style=\"padding-top:6px; line-height:30px;\"><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"陰暗洛奇亞\">陰暗洛奇亞</a></span></div> <div style=\"float:right;\">&#160;&#160;</div>\n</th>\n<td class=\"at-r va-c\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"\"><span class=\"va-c\"><b><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">HP</span><span style=\"font-size:27px;\">300</span></b></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/45px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/60px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"roundyleft-6 roundyright-20 at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); display:none;\">從[[:Category:（TCG）|]]進化\n</td>\n<td style=\";\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"textwhite a-r at-c roundybr-30\" style=\"color:initial;font-size:0.9em;width:100%;background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#e7c4da 3%, #b1e1f5 50%, #cce7c8 100%); display:none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/b/b1/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97_%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%BC%81%E5%88%92.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10px;text-shadow:2px 2px 10px #2e5b92;\"><i><b>陰暗洛奇亞<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96ex%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超級進化ex（TCG）\">超級進化</a>後的樣子</b></i></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"at-l\">\n<table width=\"40%\" class=\"a-r at-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#110404 2%,#E02929 38%,#110404 60%);\" class=\"bd-OR bw-2 roundytl-60 textwhite\"><big><i><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A9%B6%E6%9E%81%E5%BC%82%E5%85%BD%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"究極異獸（TCG）\">究極異獸</a></i></big>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c bg- roundybr-30 roundyleft\" style=\"width:90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"textwhite\" style=\"width:22%;\"><big><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"></span></big>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundybr-30 roundytl textwhite\" style=\"font-size:0.9em;height:1em;background:#000;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-超C textwhite\" style=\"background:#FFF; height:170px; border-width:3px; width:430px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b3/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg/170px-%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"242\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b3/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg/255px-%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/b/b3/%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg/340px-%E9%BB%91%E6%9A%97%E6%B4%9B%E5%A5%87%E4%BA%9APCG-P.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"display:none;\"><small>&#160;</small>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<table width=\"95%\" class=\"bg-心金 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br style=\"display:none;\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:55%;\" class=\"a-r at-l b-银 bgl-卡洛斯 roundybr-25 roundytl-25\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textblack\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">這隻寶可夢是擁有<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%B6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"惡（TCG）\"><img alt=\"惡\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/20px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/30px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/40px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>2種屬性的寶可夢。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>このポケモンは<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%B6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"惡（TCG）\"><img alt=\"惡\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/20px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/30px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/40px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>の2つのタイプを持つポケモンです。</small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>This Pokémon is both <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%81%B6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"惡（TCG）\"><img alt=\"惡\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/20px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/30px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/2/21/%E6%81%B6_TCG.png/40px-%E6%81%B6_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span> type.</small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:55%;\" class=\"a-r at-l bl-乱世 bgl-宝可梦卡牌岛 roundybr-25 roundytl-25\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textblack\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">1副牌組只能放1張<b><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%E2%98%86%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢☆（TCG）\">寶可夢</a></b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%E2%98%86%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢☆（TCG）\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/25px-Shiningsymbol.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/38px-Shiningsymbol.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/50px-Shiningsymbol.png 2x\" /></a></span>卡。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small><b>ポケモン</b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%E2%98%86%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢☆（TCG）\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/25px-Shiningsymbol.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/38px-Shiningsymbol.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/50px-Shiningsymbol.png 2x\" /></a></span>は、デッキに1枚しか入れることができません。</small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>You can't have more than 1 Pokémon <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%E2%98%86%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢☆（TCG）\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/25px-Shiningsymbol.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/38px-Shiningsymbol.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/7/7d/Shiningsymbol.png/50px-Shiningsymbol.png 2x\" /></a></span> in your deck.</small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:55%;\" class=\"a-r at-l b-银 bgl-卡洛斯 roundybr-25 roundytl-25\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textblack\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6ex%EF%BC%88%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%96%E4%BB%A3%EF%BC%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"寶可夢ex（第三世代）（TCG）\">寶可夢ex</a><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8F%E5%8E%A5%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"瀕死（TCG）\">瀕死</a></b>時，對手玩家獲得2張<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%96%E8%B5%8F%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"獎賞卡（TCG）\">獎賞卡</a>。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>ポケモンexが<b>きぜつ</b>したとき、相手プレイヤーはサイドを2枚とります。</small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small>When Pokémon-ex has been <b>Knocked Out</b>, your opponent takes <b>2 Prize cards</b>.</small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"a-c at-l bd-黑 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textwhite bgd-超C roundy-5\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">將自己手牌中2張陰暗洛奇亞LEGEND加以組合，放置於備戰區。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">手札にある2枚の{{{jname}}}LEGENDを組み合わせて、ベンチに出す。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Put this card from your hand onto your Bench only with the other half of {{{ename}}} LEGEND.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><table class=\"a-c\" style=\"width:95%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/30px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/40px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超（TCG）\"><img alt=\"超\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/1/1b/%E8%B6%85_TCG.png/20px-%E8%B6%85_TCG.png\" decoding=\"a